<title>USA: Tosco has &quot;release&quot; at Bayway, NJ refinery.</title>
<headline>Tosco has &quot;release&quot; at Bayway, NJ refinery.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tosco Corp had an extraordinary release of gases from its 290,000 barrel per day (bpd) Bayway refinery in Linden, New Jersey late Wednesday or early Thursday, a fire official in Linden said.</p>
<p>&quot;It was some type of release,&quot; the official said. She did not elaborate.  </p>
<p>Traders were saying early Thursday talk was circulating in petroleum market that the company had had some sort of difficultly at the plant, possibly a fire.</p>
<p>Tosco officials could not be immediately reached for comment.</p>
<p>-- New York Energy Desk 1 212 859 1633</p>
</text>
